.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# Nothing here is built, so there is no build output to ignore. If you ever add a
# static host's CLI (netlify, vercel), ignore its local state here.
.netlify/
.vercel/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Kept out of the public repo, September 2026. The GitHub remote is PUBLIC, and
# the repo's job there is to serve the site, not to publish the workshop.
#
# iterations/ is 28M of design notes: every removed draft, every internal
# deliberation, and the reasoning behind decisions that were reversed. Nothing
# on the live site links to it, so excluding it costs the site nothing. The
# local copies are untouched and are still the reference library CLAUDE.md and
# DESIGN-SYSTEM.md point at. If the remote ever goes private, delete these two
# lines and `git add iterations` to publish it again.
iterations/

# The prototype's build scripts have to contain the internal Amazon surface
# names verbatim, because their whole job is to substitute those names out of
# the generated HTML. That makes them unpublishable by construction, unlike
# their output: prototypes/basket-building/index.html is generated, scrubbed,
# and ships, because work/basket-building.html embeds it in an iframe.
prototypes/**/*.py
